{"schema":"aakar.tutorial.pack","schemaVersion":"2.0","minimumAakarVersion":"8.15.7","units":"mm","executionPolicy":"declarative-only","assemblyIncluded":false,"packId":"aakar.vases-plus","title":"Aakar Parametric Vase Tutorials Plus (needs Aakar 8.15.7)","category":"Vases","courses":[{"id":"vases.scales","title":"Dragon-Scale Vase","category":"Vases","level":"Advanced","estimatedMinutes":45,"objective":"Cover a vase with overlapping, downward-pointing scales: the new Scales pattern, its lean, depth and density.","tags":["scales","faceted","vase","pattern","profile"],"steps":[{"title":"Profile","learn":"A barrel profile shows the overlapping scales well.","instructions":["Model › Sketch on XZ.","Draw an open spline from foot to mouth."],"why":"Scales look best on a vase with a clear belly.","checkpoint":{"expected":"A barrel-shaped open profile."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","tool":"sketch","tab":"model","toolPath":"Model › Sketch (K)","build":[{"sketch":{"key":"prof","name":"Vase profile","plane":"XZ","ents":[{"t":"spline","pts":[[42,0],[56,25],[63,70],[58,115],[46,150]],"closed":false}],"offset":0}}]},{"title":"Start from diamonds","learn":"Scales are a variation of the diamond pattern, so start there.","instructions":["NURBS › Faceted: Diamond, 14 around, 9 rows, depth 4."],"why":"Knowing the plain pattern first makes the scale lean easy to see.","checkpoint":{"expected":"A diamond-faceted vase."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","tool":"x9fac","tab":"surface","toolPath":"NURBS › Faceted","build":[{"feature":{"key":"F","type":"x9Faceted","name":"Scale vase","params":{"profile":"$prof","cols":14,"rows":9,"depth":4,"style":"diamond","wall":3,"base":4,"pos":[0,0,0],"lean":0.55}}}],"expect":{"bodies":1}},{"title":"Switch to Scales","learn":"The Scales pattern tilts each facet’s peak downward, like a roof tile.","instructions":["Double-click the vase.","Pattern Scales (staggered, pointing down)."],"why":"Overlap comes from the lean, not from extra geometry.","checkpoint":{"expected":"Overlapping scales, pointing down."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","build":[{"update":{"ref":"F","params":{"style":"scale"}}}]},{"title":"Stronger overlap","learn":"Scale lean is how far the peak slides toward the lower corner.","instructions":["Scale lean 0.8, depth 5, 16 around, 12 rows."],"why":"Lean 0 equals the diamond pattern; around 0.8 reads as dragon scales.","checkpoint":{"expected":"Deep, strongly overlapping scales."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","build":[{"update":{"ref":"F","params":{"lean":0.8,"depth":5,"cols":16,"rows":12}}}]},{"title":"Finer scales","learn":"More rows and columns make smaller scales, like a fish.","instructions":["26 around, 20 rows, depth 3, lean 0.65."],"why":"Scale size should follow the object size: smaller scales read as fish, larger as dragon.","checkpoint":{"expected":"A fine fish-scale texture."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","build":[{"update":{"ref":"F","params":{"lean":0.65,"depth":3,"cols":26,"rows":20}}}]},{"title":"Reshape the body","learn":"The scales follow the profile.","instructions":["Double-click “Vase profile”.","Fuller belly, narrower mouth."],"why":"Every scale is regenerated, so you never edit them one by one.","checkpoint":{"expected":"The same scale pattern on a rounder vase."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","build":[{"update":{"ref":"prof","params":{"data":{"pts":[{"id":"O","x":0,"y":0,"fixed":true,"ref":true},{"id":"XA","x":1,"y":0,"fixed":true,"ref":true},{"id":"YA","x":0,"y":1,"fixed":true,"ref":true},{"id":"p1","x":46,"y":0},{"id":"p2","x":66,"y":28},{"id":"p3","x":78,"y":68},{"id":"p4","x":56,"y":115},{"id":"p5","x":40,"y":150}],"ents":[{"id":"AX","type":"line","p1":"O","p2":"XA","ref":true,"constr":true},{"id":"AY","type":"line","p1":"O","p2":"YA","ref":true,"constr":true},{"type":"spline","pts":["p1","p2","p3","p4","p5"],"closed":false,"p1":"p1","p2":"p5","id":"e1"}],"cons":[]}}}}]},{"title":"Wall and base","learn":"Set the hollow shell thickness.","instructions":["Wall 2.5 mm, base 5 mm."],"why":"Pointed scales add volume, so keep the wall thin.","checkpoint":{"expected":"A lighter, hollow vase."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","build":[{"update":{"ref":"F","params":{"wall":2.5,"base":5}}}]},{"title":"Back to bumps","learn":"Lean 0 returns to diamonds: the same feature, the same inputs.","instructions":["Scale lean 0."],"why":"One feature with a few switches covers a whole family of textures.","checkpoint":{"expected":"The diamond pattern again."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","build":[{"update":{"ref":"F","params":{"lean":0}}}]},{"title":"Choose and export","learn":"Set the look you like and export it.","instructions":["Scale lean 0.7, then Model › Mesh check and 3MF."],"why":"A faceted solid is already printable.","checkpoint":{"expected":"A printable dragon-scale vase."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","tool":"x814mf","tab":"model","toolPath":"Model › 3MF","build":[{"update":{"ref":"F","params":{"lean":0.7}}}]}],"thumb":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},{"id":"vases.param","title":"Parameter-Driven Vase","category":"Vases","level":"Master","estimatedMinutes":60,"objective":"Drive a vase from two global parameters, width and height, so that one number resizes it and re-counts its flutes.","tags":["parameters","equations","vase","linked values","parametric"],"steps":[{"title":"Define the parameters","learn":"Global parameters are named numbers any feature can use. Here: a width and a height.","instructions":["Model › Parameters.","Add W = 60 and H = 150."],"why":"Naming the key dimensions is the first step of every parametric design.","checkpoint":{"expected":"Two parameters, W and H."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","tool":"x10par","tab":"model","toolPath":"Model › Parameters","build":[{"param":{"name":"W","expr":"60"}},{"param":{"name":"H","expr":"150"}}]},{"title":"A derived parameter","learn":"Parameters can use other parameters. Add a flute count that grows with the width.","instructions":["Add FL = round(W/6)."],"why":"A formula turns one input into several consistent outputs.","checkpoint":{"expected":"FL evaluates to 10."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","tool":"x10par","tab":"model","toolPath":"Model › Parameters","build":[{"param":{"name":"FL","expr":"round(W/6)"}}]},{"title":"Profile","learn":"A unit-scale profile that the vase will scale.","instructions":["Model › Sketch on XZ.","Draw a spline: radius 30 at the belly, 150 tall."],"why":"The shape is drawn once at a known size; the parameters scale it.","checkpoint":{"expected":"A profile about 150 mm tall."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","tool":"sketch","tab":"model","toolPath":"Model › Sketch (K)","build":[{"sketch":{"key":"prof","name":"Vase profile","plane":"XZ","ents":[{"t":"spline","pts":[[22,0],[32,22],[38,62],[30,104],[22,132],[19,150]],"closed":false}],"offset":0}}]},{"title":"The vase","learn":"A normal parametric vase for now.","instructions":["NURBS › Vase: pick the profile.","Flutes 10, depth 0.08, twist 60°."],"why":"Start with plain numbers, then replace them with expressions.","checkpoint":{"expected":"A fluted vase."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","tool":"x6new","tab":"surface","toolPath":"NURBS › Vase","build":[{"feature":{"key":"V","type":"x6Vase","name":"Parametric vase","params":{"profile":"$prof","flutes":10,"depth":0.08,"sharp":1.5,"twist":60,"phase":0,"scale":1,"hscale":1,"around":72,"rows":28,"pos":[0,0,0]}}}],"expect":{"items":1}},{"title":"Link the radius to W","learn":"Typing =W/60 in a dimension box links it to the parameter.","instructions":["Select the vase, open Dimensions.","Radius scale: =W/60."],"why":"A linked value shows in blue and follows the parameter.","checkpoint":{"expected":"Radius scale is now driven by W."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","tool":"x10par","tab":"model","toolPath":"Model › Parameters","build":[{"link":{"ref":"V","key":"scale","expr":"W/60"}}]},{"title":"Link the height to H","learn":"The same for the height scale.","instructions":["Height scale: =H/150."],"why":"Both numbers now come from named, meaningful parameters.","checkpoint":{"expected":"Height scale is driven by H."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","build":[{"link":{"ref":"V","key":"hscale","expr":"H/150"}}]},{"title":"Link the flutes to FL","learn":"Flute count comes from the derived parameter.","instructions":["Flutes: =FL."],"why":"Chains of parameters keep related dimensions consistent.","checkpoint":{"expected":"Flutes are driven by FL."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","build":[{"link":{"ref":"V","key":"flutes","expr":"FL"}}]},{"title":"Change one number","learn":"Set the width to 90. The whole vase is rebuilt.","instructions":["Parameters panel: W = 90."],"why":"The scale grows to 1.5, FL becomes 15, and the vase re-counts its flutes by itself.","checkpoint":{"expected":"A wider vase with more flutes."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","build":[{"param":{"name":"W","expr":"90"}}]},{"title":"Make it tall and slim","learn":"Change both numbers.","instructions":["W = 42, H = 220."],"why":"This is the point of a parametric model: a few numbers control the whole shape.","checkpoint":{"expected":"A tall, slim vase with 7 flutes."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","build":[{"param":{"name":"W","expr":"42"}},{"param":{"name":"H","expr":"220"}}]},{"title":"Check the links","learn":"See what drives what.","instructions":["Open Parameters and look at the Linked values table."],"why":"Always keep a record of which values are driven by which parameters.","recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","tool":"x10par","tab":"model","toolPath":"Model › Parameters"},{"title":"Second vase from the same parameters","learn":"Link another vase to the same parameters, with a different offset.","instructions":["Add a second vase with pos X 150, link scale =W/60*0.8."],"why":"Reusing parameters keeps a whole collection in step.","checkpoint":{"expected":"A second vase that follows W and H at 80 %."},"recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\".","tool":"x6new","tab":"surface","toolPath":"NURBS › Vase","build":[{"feature":{"key":"V2","type":"x6Vase","name":"Parametric vase 2","params":{"profile":"$prof","flutes":8,"depth":0.1,"sharp":2.5,"twist":-60,"phase":0,"scale":1,"hscale":1,"around":72,"rows":28,"pos":[150,0,0]}}},{"link":{"ref":"V2","key":"scale","expr":"W/60*0.8"}},{"link":{"ref":"V2","key":"hscale","expr":"H/150*0.8"}}]},{"title":"Save","learn":"Parameters are saved with the project.","instructions":["File › Save."],"why":"Reopen the file and change W to see everything rebuild.","recovery":"Press Ctrl+Z, then repeat this step with exactly the values listed under \"Aakar will build\"."}],"thumb":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"}]}